    #      against the manifest, the summary and the record; its references
    #      against this log's own derivation with part 6 P2's comparison script
    #      (extracted from records/logs/m1p6-p2/run.log and checked against the
    #      hash that log printed), cell for cell, with a planted control; and
    #      each workbook's `formula` line (added, replaced) against the
    #      derivation (P2 rulings 7, 9 and 10). The left-out tests are named with
    #      their class (ruling 5).
    # No corpus reference, value or text is printed: the references are compared
    # and counted only, and live in the list, which is not committed (P2 ruling
    # 9); the log prints its sha256 and byte count.
    #
    # WRITTEN FOR M1 part 8 P2 from part 8 P1's run script (printed in
